stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> idle
    idle --> preparing: start · restore · adopt
    preparing --> active: window located<br/>+ overlays shown
    preparing --> ending: timeout · failure<br/>· end · expiry
    active --> degraded: extension disconnected<br/>· focus window missing
    degraded --> active: window re-verified
    active --> ending: expiry · user end<br/>· extension ended
    degraded --> ending: 120 s · end · expiry
    ending --> idle: ack · disconnect · 4 s
